{"channelId":"UCbVGQF6JYTnSY8-a6y_MlLg","row":["The Horse Listener",1720,"Welcome to The Horse Listener — where you learn to see what your horse has been showing you all along.\n\nI'm Nika Vorster — equine bodyworker, MSc Equine Chiropractic, and guide for Horse Listeners.\n\nYour horse is your mirror  — reflecting exactly what YOU need to change.\n\nIf your horse is:\n🐎 Showing \"mystery\" behaviours no expert can explain\n🐎 Struggling despite trying everything\n🐎 Telling you something's wrong—but no one can find it\n\nI help female riders:\n✅ Observe what their horse is reflecting\n✅ Ask the right questions\n✅ Test different approaches\n✅ Adjust based on what the mirror shows\n\nThis isn't mystical. It's practical, repeatable, and works with any horse.\n\nBecause your horse has been telling you the whole time.\n\n📍 Dubai | Coaching riders worldwide\n\nJoin The Horse Listener\nhttps://nikavorster.com/the-horse-listener\n\nJoin the Daily Email\nhttps://nikavorster.com/newsletter\n\nSubscribe for horse transformations, bodywork insights, and the truth about what your horse is showing you.","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbVGQF6JYTnSY8-a6y_MlLg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbVGQF6JYTnSY8-a6y_MlLg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:08.769Z","channelId":"UCbVGQF6JYTnSY8-a6y_MlLg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"a4bf6a13f8a13d999516a828b1ac46c58aee7219f314943877734b6eda800efe","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"1ff4495db78579fcb58b2c33df4ac2c6cd5579b14501ed5464b13b6d3a4e40aa"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbVGQF6JYTnSY8-a6y_MlLg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:48:00.461Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbVGQF6JYTnSY8-a6y_MlLg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1720,"raw":"1.72K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbVGQF6JYTnSY8-a6y_MlLg","obse